  <p id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit023" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">故尚書僕射<persName id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit023:m0000" ref="56f_8f7_e9f">杜畿</persName>於孟津試船遂至覆没忠之至也朕甚愍焉追贈太僕諡曰戴侯子<persName id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit023:m0001" ref="56f_8f7_e9f_A">恕</persName>嗣</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit025" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit025:m0000" ref="56f_8f7_e9f_A">恕</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-016-duji-dushu:unit025:m0001" ref="56f_8f7_e9f_A">務伯</persName>太和中為㪚騎黃門侍郎</p>
